  "id": 196,
  "description": "# 🏴‍☠️ OnePiece Guild 🏴‍☠️\n### 🗡 Answer the Call of Adventure! \n\n⚓ **Set Sail on 15th August, 2024**\n\nReady to embark on the Grand Line and become part of the best pirate crew IdleMMO has to offer? Look no further! OnePiece is now recruiting brave souls to join our ranks. Whether you&#039;re a seasoned veteran or a newcomer eager to write your legend, know that you have a place in our guild.\n\n### JOIN REQUIREMENTS\n- **Combat Level 60+** ⚔\n- **Active participation in guild raids** 🌋\n- **Contribution to guild challenges** 🎯\n- **Joining the Discord server is mandatory (for strategy/communication/banter)** 📜\n- **Active interaction with other members** 💪\n\n### RAID SCHEDULE (EVERY DAY)\n- **FIRST RAID - 13:30 PM GMT/UTC** 🕧\n- **SECOND RAID - 4 PM GMT/UTC**  🕒\n\n### KICK CONDITIONS\n- **Inactivity for 3+ days without notice** 🚫\n- **Failure to contribute to guild activities**  🚫\n- **Performing actions that are against the rules of the game** 🚫\n\n### HOW TO APPLY\nVisit the #applications channel on our Discord server or the recruitment thread in the official IdleMMO Discord. Wait for someone from High Command to contact you for further instructions, and viola!  \n\n**Wealth, fame, power. Together we&#039;ll seize it all!**\n**Maybe the One Piece was the friends we made along the way...**\n\n#### FEEL FREE TO JOIN OUR DISCORD SERVER 👋\n#### https://discord.com/invite/VNYCkSN4nf",
